	(text "In the board default config, TRACE uses \n3.3v logic, and SWD/JTAG uses 5v.\n\nThe 20 pin TRACE connector has DNP resistors\nfor the JTAG/SWD to allow a non-5v capable\ntrace analyzer to be used in addition to\na separate SWD debugger on the 10 pin connector\n\nAlternatively, if a 5V trace is present, \nthe pads can be bridged to allow SWD.\n\nAnother option is selecting 3.3 V for VDD_HV_A\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 197.866 94.742 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d1a99afc-4abc-4acf-b66c-28d5f9a692e9")
	)
